      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$AB^2 = 2500^2 + 500^2 = 6500000$ ومنه $AB \\approx 2550$ m.",
        "incorrect": "$HB = 1400 - 900$ ، ثم $AB^2 = AH^2 + HB^2$ ."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$HB = 1400 - 900 = 500$ m.",
          "$AB^2 = AH^2 + HB^2 = 2500^2 + 500^2 = 6250000 + 250000 = 6500000$",
          "$AB = \\sqrt{6500000} \\approx 2549{,}5$ ، أي $AB \\approx 2550$ m."
        ],
        "result": "AB \\approx 2550m"
      },
